{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46088","headline":"少监三首 一 · 贯休","name":"少监三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"器琢仙珪美有余，席珍国宝比难如。\n衔花乳燕看调瑟，衣锦佳人侍读书。\n荀氏门风龙变化，谢家庭树玉扶疎。\n即期寰海隆平日，归佐吾皇侍玉除。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46088.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46088","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}